Usage of construct:
  -after string
    	current workspace manifest for api-diff
  -before string
    	previous workspace manifest for api-diff
  -compiler string
    	Gooo compiler executable (default "gooo")
  -construction-cases string
    	caller expectations used by construct
  -declaration string
    	optional .gooo declaration file to bind to the discovery
  -entry string
    	entry activity for reference or construct
  -evaluation-cases string
    	adaptive cases for construct; failures feed the next round
  -fill-model string
    	optional operation-classifier model for construct source_fill preparation
  -holdout-cases string
    	optional final evaluation after selection stops; never fed back
  -input string
    	splice/diagnostic/feature-audit input file, or completed verify output directory for receipt
  -max-program-budget int
    	construct ceiling for whole-program attempts per round (1..64) (default 8)
  -max-rounds int
    	construct ceiling for fresh construction rounds (1..16) (default 4)
  -model string
    	optional model.json path or builtin; omission is deterministic
  -out string
    	new output directory
  -package string
    	Gooo package directory for reference
  -profile string
    	starter profile: scalar, record, or library (default "record")
  -query string
    	natural-language capability question for discover
  -source string
    	Gooo source for construct
  -workspace string
    	Gooo package manifest for construct; exclusive with --source/--entry
